OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FScattered
OL,6,Fshowers continuing this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight, with some clearer spells
OL,8,Fdeveloping at times. Feeling a little
OL,9,Fcooler than last night, especially
OL,10,Funder clearer skies.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA morning of sunny spells
OL,13,Fand a scattering of showers, although
OL,14,Fshowers tending to ease midday
OL,15,Fonwards. Many areas becoming dry
OL,16,Fthroughout the afternoon, with
OL,17,Ftemperatures nearer average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
