OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain
OL,6,Freturns on Friday, potentially heavy
OL,7,Ffor a time. This rain continuing into
OL,8,FSaturday before turning drier and
OL,9,Fbrighter on Sunday. Temperatures near
OL,10,For slightly above average for early
OL,11,FOctober.
